<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Additions to Alpha Genes' wretch blacklists, so wretches are not generated with: Biotech Expansion's
		shearable/milkable genes, Big and Small's extreme temperature needs and Simply Robots' android parts, Starjack's
		extreme oxygen sensitivity and gene randomizer, and anything named like sleeve quality, astrogenes, VRE pollution
		genes or the Grigori fertility gene. VPE's Thrall trait joins Alpha Genes' blacklisted traits.
		This folder only loads when Alpha Genes is active (see loadFolders.xml).

		The DLL that made the germline mutator respect these lists is no longer here: it became the separate mod
		"Alpha Genes - Germline Mutator Blacklist" (1.7 only), which has its own default list and settings menu.

		Fix: the VPE Thrall entry was gated on "VanillaExpanded.VanillaExpanded.VPsycastsE", a doubled packageId no mod has,
		so it never loaded; it now uses VPE's real packageId.
		Verified against the current 1.6 releases: every target def exists, no entry is already on Alpha Genes' lists, and
		the listed genes/trait exist in their installed mods (Biotech Expansion and Simply Robots are not installed here).
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationSequence">
		<operations>
			<li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
				<xpath>Defs/AlphaGenes.BlackListedTraitsDef[defName="AG_BlackListedTraits"]/blackListedTraits</xpath>
				<value>
					<li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VPsycastsE">VPE_Thrall</li>
				</value>
			</li>
			<li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
				<xpath>Defs/AlphaGenes.WretchBlacklistDef[defName="AG_WretchBlacklistDef"]/blackListedGenes</xpath>
				<value>
					<!-- covered in the code: genes with prerequisite, archite genes, AG_OnlyOnCharacterCreation, genes from VRE - Insector -->
					<!-- covered by the author: B&S, WVC -->
					<li MayRequire="biotexpans.core">BTE_ShearableGene</li>
					<li MayRequire="biotexpans.core">BTE_MilkableGene</li>
					<li MayRequire="RedMattis.BigSmall.Core">MinTemp_HugeNeed</li>
					<li MayRequire="RedMattis.BigSmall.Core">MaxTemp_HugeNeed</li>
					<li MayRequire="RedMattis.BigSmall.SimpleAndroids">BS_CommandoHead</li>
					<li MayRequire="RedMattis.BigSmall.SimpleAndroids">BS_CommandoBody</li>
					<li MayRequire="RedMattis.BigSmall.SimpleAndroids">BS_TVHead</li>
					<li MayRequire="vanillaracesexpanded.starjack">VREStarjack_OxygenSensitivity_Extreme</li>
					<li MayRequire="vanillaracesexpanded.starjack">VREStarjack_Gene_Randomizer</li>
				</value>
			</li>
			<li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
				<xpath>Defs/AlphaGenes.WretchBlacklistDef[defName="AG_WretchBlacklistDef"]/blackListedDefNameStrings</xpath>
				<value>
					<li>AC_SleeveQuality_</li>
					<li>_Astrogene</li>
					<li>VRE_Pollution</li>
					<!-- turns pawn into Grigori: string-based as this might be removed...should I just use string for all cases?-->
					<li>BS_GrigoriFertile</li>
				</value>
			</li>
		</operations>
	</Operation>

	<!--
		Alpha Genes' archotech gene remover, endogenefier and xenogenefier count as archotech tech level, like the other
		archotech tech-level changes in this mod. Verified: none of the three sets a techLevel upstream.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationSequence">
		<operations>
			<li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
				<xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="AG_ArchoGeneRemover" or defName="AG_ArchoEndogenefier" or defName="AG_ArchoXenogenefier"]</xpath>
				<value>
					<techLevel>Archotech</techLevel>
				</value>
			</li>
		</operations>
	</Operation>

	<!--
		With Integrated Implants, Alpha Genes' increased command range gene gives +15 to Integrated Implants' mech remote
		control distance stat (TMM_AG_IncreasedCommandRange, Defs/HediffDefs.xml) instead of Alpha Genes' own hediff, which
		sets command range to 35 tiles; the description is updated to match. Its opposite gene is cherry-picked in
		MMMM_Convergence-Genetics. Verified: the gene's hediff and descriptions are as described, and the stat exists in Integrated
		Implants.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationSequence">
		<operations>
			<li Class="PatchOperationSequence" MayRequire="lts.I">
				<operations>
					<li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
						<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="AG_IncreasedCommandRange"]/modExtensions/li[@Class="VEF.Genes.GeneExtension"]/hediffToWholeBody</xpath>
						<value>
							<hediffToWholeBody>TMM_AG_IncreasedCommandRange</hediffToWholeBody>
						</value>
					</li>
					<li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
						<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="AG_IncreasedCommandRange"]/customEffectDescriptions</xpath>
						<value>
							<customEffectDescriptions>
								<li>Mech command range +15</li>
								<li>This gene is only active if the carrier is a mechanitor.</li>
							</customEffectDescriptions>
						</value>
					</li>
				</operations>
			</li>
		</operations>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
